[00:13.76]God’s Word and all it promises
[00:18.16]Give reason to endure.
[00:22.72]The things you’ve learned and come to love
[00:27.32]Are all well-founded and sure.
[00:31.86]Be stabilized in holy faith,
[00:36.56]Keeping God’s day close in mind.
[00:41.00]Stand firm in your integrity;
[00:45.54]By tests you will be refined.
[00:52.09]Maintain the love you had at first,
[00:57.00]Which somehow could be lost.
[01:01.62]Despite the trials you will meet,
[01:06.02]Endure no matter the cost.
[01:10.63]Whatever test may come your way,
[01:15.25]Never yield to doubt or fear.
[01:19.80]Jehovah will provide escape,
[01:24.46]Our God ever will be near.
[01:31.30]All those enduring to the end
[01:35.66]Are those who will be saved.
[01:40.40]The book of life will list their names,
[01:45.12]A record clearly engraved.
[01:49.20]So let endurance be your aim;
[01:53.96]Let it have its work complete.
[01:58.67]Jehovah’s favor you will know;
[02:03.14]With joy you will be replete.
